@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Container liveness only; does not check PostgreSQL or authentication.
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Dashboard endpoints require an authenticated HTTPS session.
### Obtain a token in the same session and copy it into @csrfToken below.
@secureBaseUrl = https://localhost:7138
@csrfToken = replace-with-antiforgery-token
@dashboardId = replace-with-dashboard-guid
@revision = replace-with-current-revision-guid

### Get an antiforgery token
GET {{secureBaseUrl}}/auth/antiforgery

### List shared dashboards
GET {{secureBaseUrl}}/api/dashboards

### Get a dashboard
GET {{secureBaseUrl}}/api/dashboards/{{dashboardId}}

### Create a dashboard
POST {{secureBaseUrl}}/api/dashboards
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Board overview"
}

### Save a dashboard using the revision returned by GET or POST
PUT {{secureBaseUrl}}/api/dashboards/{{dashboardId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Board overview",
  "revision": "{{revision}}",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "type": "Text",
      "title": "Notes",
      "content": "Board notes",
      "column": 0,
      "row": 0,
      "width": 2,
      "height": 2
    }
  ]
}
